  "caveat": "Stock vs flow, never combined into a ratio: prison population is a snapshot on 31 December 2025; NINo flow is one rolling year of new registrations. Geographic scope differs: FNO is England and Wales only, NINo is UK-wide. Concept differs: MOJ records nationality of the prisoner; NINo records nationality self-declared at registration. Both numbers tell you nothing about whether overseas arrivals commit crime at any particular rate, because we have no per-individual link between the two datasets and no shared denominator. The bridge is offered to surface composition only.",
